{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54631","headline":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无云气，天色十分晴。\n蓦地一声如雷响，或如霹雳野鷄惊，龙出没灾刑。\n（经曰：「谓之天鼓，亦主兵火。\n」又曰：「龙出。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}